              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barbara"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I baked for 20 minutes and it was heated through. The noodles were already beginning to dry out. An hour is too long to bake the casserole. Also, 1 cup of ham for six servings seems a little light if this is supposed to be an entree. As a side dish, a cup would work. I added frozen peas for color &amp; texture. Overall, good flavor and a keeper.",
